{
  "$comment": "How FastFighting DCC reads the books' English: monsters' stat lines and the rows of crit, fumble and spell tables. Patterns are regular expressions over the text, lower case; {name} in one is a piece from parts ({dice} and {formula}, a dice term, are the code's). A translation is a copy of this file named for its language (de.json), merged over this one. See CODING_README.md.",
